've played an earlier build, you'll notice the difference the moment you drop into a match.Everything Else Got Some Love TooAlongside the phys","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T19:18:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262698087","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4643890-1840944183785273","game_id":"steam-4643890","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Playtest Live Now. Come Hunt or Be Hunted!","summary":"The playtest is live and we want you in it.Hantu and Hunted is a 4v2 asymmetric horror prop hunt. Four humans morph into objects to survive the night. Two Hantu(ghosts) drawn from Southeast Asian folklore hunt them down. But hiding won't save you forever, and not every prop is what it seems.This is an early build and we're testing it with the community first. Your feedback directly shapes where the game goes, balance, mechanics, the hunt itself.How to get in: Join our Discord and grab a playtest","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T06:51:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785273","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4643890-1836506165559681","game_id":"steam-4643890","kind":"announcement","title":"Hantu and Hunted - Gameplay Reveal Trailer","summary":"The Gameplay Reveal Trailer is Here.We've been quiet. Now you get to see why.We've been quiet. Now you get to see why.Hantu and Hunted is an asymmetric multiplayer horror game rooted in Southeast Asian folklore. 2 Players steps into the Ghost Realm as a powerful Hantus, and the humans fight to survive long enough to make it out.The trailer is live. Watch it below.This is just the beginning of what we're showing. Wishlist now to stay in the loop as we reveal more of what's waiting in the Ghost Re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-29T09:18:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165559681","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:35:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4643890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4643890":"2026-10-26T03:17:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4643890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5379170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T03:17:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4643890","app_id":4643890,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:45Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"784431564373c67a534dfe93afe52dd1d11dab974182200d13970ecf1ba6de0a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"사람일 때는 물건으로 변신해서 살아남고, 귀신일 때는 동남아시아 전설 속 귀신이 되어 사냥해 보세요. 가까이 있으면 목소리가 들리는 무서운 숨바꼭질 게임이에요. 숨고, 사냥하고, 탈출하세요","publishers":[{"name":"Zeevium Games","creator_clan_account_id":46088387}],"developers":[{"name":"Zeevium Games","creator_clan_account_id":46088387}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796214600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full","is_early_access":true},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Steam Fest Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791890139","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4643890/1632639172/8a45d2146b88da6908b20dbfa3ef4